WEBVTT

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:13.760
PREV. FIGHTER OF NOGI GROUP

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.180
<i>The Dive King: Shigeru Komada.</i>

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:17.850
PREV. FIGHTER OF YOSHITAKE REAL ESTATE

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.390
<i>The Russian Reaper: Ivan Karaev.</i>

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.430
<i>These two ex-fighters are now...</i>

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.020
LIHITO (ICHIRO NAKATA)

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.230
<i>...employed by SH Frozen Storage</i>
<i>run by Lihito.</i>

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.820
VICE-PRESIDENTS

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:31.030
Cheers!

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.410
<i>Drinking after work is superb.</i>

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:36.910
<i>Definitely.</i>

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:39.540
<i>Right! Labor is divine.</i>

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.250
<i>-Lihito!</i>
<i>-Huh?</i>

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.080
<i>I misunderstood you.</i>

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:48.540
<i>I was almost killed by you, but</i>
<i>you actually are a good guy, President!</i>

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.420
<i>-Now you see it?</i>
<i>-Yeah.</i>

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:55.630
<i>You're kind enough</i>
<i>to give both of us new jobs.</i>

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:58.510
<i>I appreciate you, Lihito.</i>

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.350
<i>Take this as a token of my gratitude.</i>

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.180
<i>That's the superior sake brand,</i>
<i>Kotozakura!</i>

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:06.560
<i>Wow, you bought it for us?</i>

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>Let's drink until we drop tonight!</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.650
<i>Yeah, until we drop dead!</i>

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.490
<i>Don't hype it up too much!</i>

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:22.830
<i>I feel so sick.</i>

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:26.000
<i>Guess I drank too much.</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.370
<i>Huh?</i>

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:38.050
<i>You're so tough.</i>

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.470
<i>Is Kengan Life-or-Death Tournament...</i>

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:46.020
<i>something you really want to join, Lihito?</i>

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:50.150
<i>Do you really need to take the risk</i>
<i>and thrust yourself into danger?</i>

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.280
<i>Well... how can I put it...</i>

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.320
<i>I can't accept it.</i>

00:01:55.570 --> 00:01:57.110
<i>Accept what?</i>

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:01.830
<i>I can hardly accept</i>
<i>that there are people stronger than me.</i>

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:05.450
<i>I may have no other chance like this.</i>

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:10.000
<i>As a man, I cannot miss it now!</i>

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.920
<i>This guy is different from us.</i>

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:19.720
<i>We chose to be fighters to live</i>
<i>but that's not his case.</i>

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:23.310
<i>It's Lihito's innocent desire...</i>

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.310
<i>to gain the title of the strongest!</i>

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.360
<i>The Super Human has come back!</i>

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.150
GAME 12

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.530
<i>Fingers are his weapons.</i>

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:40.200
<i>His extraordinary grip strength</i>
<i>makes it possible...</i>

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.370
SAYAKA KATAHARA
DAUGHTER OF METSUDO KATAHARA

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:44.030
...to rip flesh and cut bone!

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:48.040
<i>He calls himself the first man</i>
<i>in kengan history</i>

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.830
<i>to be a fighting member</i>
<i>of the association.</i>

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.000
<i>Now he is bravely making his comeback!</i>

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:56.380
<i>Standing at 188 cm and weighing 102 kg,</i>

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.510
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>five wins and one loss.</i>

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:03.510
Representing SH Frozen Storage,
which is making its first appearance,

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:06.260
<i>also known as Lihito the Super Human,</i>

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:10.890
<i>Ichiro Nakata!</i>

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:15.520
Nakata!

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:18.280
Don't call me by my real name!

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.780
Please don't, Sayaka.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:25.740
<i>And next comes the man</i>
<i>who'll fight against the Super Human!</i>

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:32.580
<i>A hatchet man has come from</i>
<i>the underground community.</i>

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:37.090
The Kure Family are not
the only assassins.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:41.590
His form is an assassination styled
martial arts originated in Okinawa

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.050
<i>called the Kaiwan Style!</i>

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:47.810
<i>Can his brutal arms live up to</i>
<i>their namesake style to win it all?</i>

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:51.520
<i>Standing at 185 cm and weighing 96 kg,</i>

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.150
<i>this is his kengan match debut.</i>

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:57.230
Representing Motor Head Motors,

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.480
<i>also known as the Devil Lance...</i>

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:04.660
<i>Gensai Kuroki!</i>

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.920
GENSAI KUROKI, REPRESENTATIVE FIGHTER
OF MOTOR HEAD MOTORS

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:58.940
THE DEVIL LANCE

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.990
The Kaiwan Style... Gensai Kuroki.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.740
REI MIKAZUCHI, REP. FIGHTER
OF GOLD PLEASURE GROUP

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.530
I thought he'd never appear in public.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:12.240
Is he strong?

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.790
RINO KURAYOSHI
CHAIRWOMAN

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.450
I'd say he's as strong as Agito Kanoh.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.500
Now I see...

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:23.170
why they avoided the match with him
when creating the tournament matchups.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:24.750
KIRIMI TAKAKAZE

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:25.710
Kuroki.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:31.220
I never expected you to say
that you'd like to join the tournament.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:34.930
You're so unlucky, old buddy,

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:38.390
that you have to fight me
in your first game.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.690
Don't blame me even if you lose, okay?

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:44.940
Whoever wins,
let's just accept the result.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.820
Yo, are you listening to me?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.620
Hey, old man.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:56.660
You're relaxed enough to sigh.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:02.130
Remember your opponent is
the Super Human, Lihito the Ripper.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.790
Don't get cocky, asshole.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.710
Behave yourself before the game!

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:08.260
All right.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.760
You're too young.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.930
Arrogant, silly and weak.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:16.010
Huh?

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.020
I'll rip you, okay?

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:22.520
Now, it's the Super Human
versus the Devil Lance.

00:07:22.850 --> 00:07:24.860
Who will survive?

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.360
Take your stance.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:33.490
Fight!

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:34.620
Here I come!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.410
You jerk!

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.830
Ouch... shit!

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.540
I took you down twice.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.420
Don't take me lightly!

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.630
Third time.

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.140
And the fourth.

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:00.310
You bastard.

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:02.640
What do you want,
stopping at the last moment?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:07.690
I don't use my fists to hit weak people.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.190
Surrender, young fighter.

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:15.320
You shouldn't hesitate to admit
the difference in our capabilities.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.030
How laughable.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:21.910
Every one of you jerks here
are underestimating me!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.580
Don't look down on me!

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:25.710
Look down on you?

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.380
It's an appropriate evaluation.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.260
<i>He's bleeding!</i>

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:37.930
<i>His killer technique Razor's Edge</i>
<i>was launched!</i>

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.390
<i>Tsk... I should make it deeper.</i>

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:43.230
Did you think I was just rolling over
for nothing?

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:46.480
I've finally gotten the hang
of your movements!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.610
Hmm... he injured Kuroki.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.570
You, young fighter.

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:56.610
I have to reevaluate you.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.240
Too late!

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.870
<i>I need to rip deeper to defeat him.</i>

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:06.370
So, your attack style is cutting.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.460
Well... that's also...

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.050
interesting.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:12.920
I'll take it.

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:21.560
<i>I don't want to admit it, but it would be</i>
<i>hard to beat this guy by myself.</i>

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.310
<i>If I stay back, he'll finish me off.</i>

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:26.600
<i>Then...</i>

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.020
<i>going forward is my only option!</i>

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.950
<i>Okay, I can see his move.</i>

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:42.870
Got it now.

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.460
I've memorized your pattern of movement!

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:50.210
Wow, this is becoming a real fight!

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:51.880
YOSHIKO TOGAWA
PRES. OF MURDER MUSIC

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:53.170
<i>Lihito...</i>

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:54.760
KEIZABURO SAWADA
(ELIMINATED)

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.880
<i>Are you Lihito of Bakada High School?</i>

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.800
<i>You look like much more of a fool</i>
<i>than I've heard.</i>

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:02.430
<i>And you're the gang leader of Kama High?</i>

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.970
<i>What a creepy look, huh?</i>

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:06.230
<i>Who're you calling creepy, ape?</i>

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:08.690
<i>Ouch! What're you doing, shitty pansy!</i>

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.480
<i>Don't underestimate me!</i>

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.900
<i>-Nuts to you!</i>
<i>-That's my line!</i>

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:18.570
<i>I've hated you ever since we first met.</i>

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:22.240
<i>If you lose to any men other than me,</i>
<i>I won't forgive you!</i>

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:26.910
<i>I can cut him.</i>

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.540
<i>My attack is working against him!</i>

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:33.550
<i>It doesn't matter</i>
<i>how strong this old man is.</i>

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.920
<i>My Razor's Edge can kill a man</i>
<i>with just one attack.</i>

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:41.140
<i>If only it hits, I can beat anybody!</i>

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:44.430
Take this!

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.180
<i>Don't let my hands distract you!</i>

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:50.690
<i>My kick can get you. See?</i>

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.190
<i>Yes, I am the Super Human.</i>

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:56.730
<i>Watch out, Tokita.</i>

00:10:57.400 --> 00:10:59.360
<i>And you too, shithead.</i>

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.660
<i>I'll never lose to anyone anymore.</i>

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:06.910
<i>I'll never let anyone take me lightly!</i>

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:10.170
Give him a fuckin' heavy one, asshole!

00:11:13.210 --> 00:11:17.050
I find this to be
more pitiful than ridiculous.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:20.880
Did you really believe
you could defeat me?

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:27.560
It's just that
I was playing with you by your rules.

00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:31.270
You can't see the difference
in our capabilities.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:34.190
That's why I said that you're weak.

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.530
Shove off, the weak.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:52.750
<i>The Kaiwan Style is an assassination</i>
<i>martial art that began in ancient Okinawa.</i>

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.750
<i>The essence of Okinawan karate,</i>
<i>Okinawan traditional martial art,</i>

00:11:57.050 --> 00:12:01.590
<i>and also Chinese martial arts are</i>
<i>included in this style.</i>

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:06.470
<i>It requires basic training for</i>
<i>a tenacious body, kata training,</i>

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:10.310
<i>and the study of meridian,</i>
<i>acupuncture points and qigong.</i>

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:14.310
<i>The most extreme among them</i>
<i>is the training for the body parts</i>

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:18.690
<i>using makiwara striking posts,</i>
<i>sand bags and iron palm.</i>

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:22.950
<i>You have to spend most of the day</i>
<i>practicing for these various trainings.</i>

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.990
<i>You just keep destroying your body</i>
<i>as if you were a self-injurer.</i>

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:29.790
<i>After going through all the torment,</i>

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.080
<i>your extremities will become like lances.</i>

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.410
<i>They call them...</i>

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.750
<i>the devil lances.</i>

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:45.390
<i>What was that?</i>

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:49.560
<i>It was heavier than ever before.</i>

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.430
Oh, well. The game is over.

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:56.650
There is no one
who can stand up to Kuroki.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.400
Too fragile.

00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:06.200
Is this the level of the kengan fighters?

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:08.450
How boring.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.450
I'll finish the game now.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:15.210
<i>What's that stupid ape doing?</i>

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.670
Stand up now, or I'll kill you!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.960
Now, now. You should stay quiet in bed.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:22.510
Stand up, asshole!

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.340
<i>Gensai Kuroki...</i>

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:27.260
<i>He's a terribly polished fighter.</i>

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:28.590
HAJIME HANAFUSA

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.970
<i>In terms of spec, Lihito has no advantage.</i>

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:35.230
<i>That's nothing more than</i>
<i>numerical talk though.</i>

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:38.810
It seems you can't even bluff anymore.

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:42.690
I feel pity for you being so weak.

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.860
I'll beat you with my full power.

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:51.120
See what power is.

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.540
<i>Ah, it's so silent.</i>

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:02.750
<i>I can see his movements very clearly.</i>

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:09.050
<i>What are those guys shouting?</i>

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:13.100
<i>It's really quiet.</i>

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:17.810
<i>As if time is standing still.</i>

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:19.900
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.270
<i>I remember.</i>

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.030
<i>When Tokita attacked me,</i>

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.700
<i>the world around me looked this way.</i>

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:31.030
<i>Someone told me before...</i>

00:14:31.740 --> 00:14:36.040
<i>that you'll see everything in slow motion</i>
<i>if you're in an extreme situation.</i>

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:38.960
<i>I see.</i>

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.500
<i>I'm in an extreme situation now.</i>

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:46.130
<i>Which means... look...</i>

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:48.340
<i>I mean...</i>

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:53.640
<i>If I can turn the game around here,</i>

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:57.270
<i>I'll create a super sensation, right?!</i>

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:10.700
Oh, awake already?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:14.660
It's amazing, you're really tough.

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.290
You can even make Seagal aghast.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.540
NAOYA OHKUBO
FIGHTER OF MUJI TELEVISION NETWORK

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.670
Where am I?

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.130
-I'm...
-No need to panic.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:25.920
We're in a waiting room for fighters,

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:28.380
because the medical office is full.

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:31.760
-Mr. Yamashita went to get the doc--
-Hey, hold on a second.

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.050
What about my match?

00:15:36.430 --> 00:15:38.310
Now you remembered.

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.230
You have the worst luck.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:45.650
<i>It's possible that the old buddy is equal</i>
<i>in strength to the Fang of Metsudo.</i>

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:51.820
<i>There may be no one in the tournament</i>
<i>who can have a satisfying game with him.</i>

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.030
Well, in fact,

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:57.830
my first opponent is the Fang of Metsudo.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.660
What a tragedy! I'd like to escape.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.290
I see.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:08.840
Oh well.
I should accept the result as it is.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:13.220
It's too late to look back on what's
already happened. I'll stop thinking!

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:16.550
Wow, even you have time
to think about something.

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:18.600
Shut up, skinhead!

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:22.480
Just show a little kindness
to the injured.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.020
Hey, where are you going?

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:28.020
To hit on girls.

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:32.820
No game anymore, and is there any reason
to have a boring time with a man?

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:36.370
Do you think you can pick up girls
in your condition, idiot?

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:39.740
Please make up some good explanation
to tell Kaede and the others.

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:41.330
See ya.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:47.250
Geez...

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:51.050
<i>He's really not good at telling a lie.</i>

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:56.010
<i>Leave it to me.</i>

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.760
<i>I promise I'll win this tournament.</i>

00:16:59.140 --> 00:17:02.310
<i>I'm going to get revenge for you!</i>

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.770
<i>Haven't you realized?</i>

00:17:06.350 --> 00:17:12.440
<i>There is no place for a normy</i>
<i>like you in this tournament.</i>

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:17.030
<i>Shove off, the weak.</i>

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:31.750
<i>The game's over!</i>

00:17:32.130 --> 00:17:34.260
<i>Now the game is finished!</i>

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:38.090
<i>The winner is the Devil Lance,</i>
<i>Gensai Kuroki!</i>

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:40.680
<i>He just kept overwhelming Lihito.</i>

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:43.680
<i>No one would dispute</i>
<i>his advance to the second round!</i>

00:17:43.810 --> 00:17:48.100
<i>The Super Human's ambition was thwarted</i>
<i>at this point in time!</i>

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.410
Damn it!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.450
Excuse me.

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.250
KAEDE AKIYAMA,
SECRETARY NOGI GROUP

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:07.830
It's almost time to go.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.000
Are you okay?
Why don't you turn the light on--

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.130
<i>His atmosphere isn't the same as usual.</i>

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.800
Oh, is it my time?

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:21.180
SEN HATSUMI
REP. FIGHTER OF NOGI GROUP

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.970
All right then, shall we go?

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:28.020
<i>Lihito lost and</i>
<i>Ohma's victory is doubtful, too.</i>

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.100
HIDEKI NOGI, CHAIRMAN OF NOGI GROUP

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:31.440
I still have Hatsumi.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:35.320
<i>But there’s no room</i>
<i>for playing it safe now.</i>

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.900
YOSHIRO YOSHITAKE
PRES. YOSHITAKE REAL ESTATE

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:41.030
Nogi, you old bastard...
You really messed around with me, huh?

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:44.160
How dare you send this assassin to me.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:49.540
Maybe your plan was to take me
as a hostage, but too bad!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.380
My motto is "no escape!"

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:56.710
All the disasters poured on me will be
directly intercepted by me!

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.130
OHMA TOKITA, REP. FIGHTER
OF YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:01.050
<i>The next game is about to begin.</i>

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.720
<i>Please get back to your seats.</i>

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.600
Hey, Ohma.

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:06.680
Yeah?

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:10.190
Do you think he'll do well?

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:11.350
Who?

00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:13.270
I mean Mr. Hatsumi.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.320
KAZUO YAMASHITA
YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.490
If no one from Nogi Group wins,
my life would be over.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:22.700
Chairman Nogi thrust
the 5.1 billion debt on me.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:26.870
-5.1 billion yen in debt, okay?
-He just needs to win. That's all.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.870
You are right there, but...

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:33.210
I don't want to admit it, but he's strong.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:35.130
Unless he gets careless.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:36.590
Besides,

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:39.670
I'm not going to lose, either.

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.010
<i>The wait is over!</i>

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:48.560
<i>It's time to begin</i>
<i>the 13th game in Block D.</i>

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:53.650
Let me introduce this man first!

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:59.240
GAME 13

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:03.570
<i>No one in kengan history has</i>
<i>ever been more irresponsible than him.</i>

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:09.330
<i>He has a reliable capability, but also</i>
<i>a moody nature that troubles his employer.</i>

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:13.540
<i>The famous Hatsumi-style aikido</i>
<i>has come back!</i>

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.210
<i>Standing at 178 cm and weighing 84 kg,</i>

00:20:17.290 --> 00:20:21.720
<i>his kengan match record is</i>
<i>39 wins and 15 losses.</i>

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.510
Total assets he's acquired is

00:20:23.590 --> 00:20:28.260
one trillion 440 billion 182 million
and 800 thousand yen.

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.850
<i>Representing Nogi Group,</i>

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:33.190
<i>also known as the Floating Cloud,</i>

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:36.940
<i>Sen Hatsumi!</i>

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:45.450
Time to get the job done.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.490
Hatsumi!

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:49.410
Wow, he's shown up!

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.700
Fight seriously today, please!

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:55.620
Can't they see how serious I am?

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.170
What?! You're...

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:01.380
the daughter of Chairman Katahara?

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:03.880
You grew up!

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:06.090
Long time no see!

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:10.470
Look, do you want to try
some adventure with me as adults?

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:13.520
Really? What are we going to do?

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:15.940
-What shall... oh?
-Oops, next introduction!

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:19.440
Let's welcome the opponent!

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:26.160
<i>We have no information</i>
<i>on this next man's background.</i>

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:31.660
Yoshitake Real Estate, now one of the most
famous companies in kengan matches,

00:21:31.790 --> 00:21:34.410
<i>decided to choose this man</i>
<i>for this tournament!</i>

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:37.370
<i>Who the heck is he?</i>

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:41.710
<i>Standing at 179 cm and weighing 85 kg,</i>

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:44.380
<i>he makes his kengan match debut today.</i>

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:47.180
Representing Yoshitake Real Estate,

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.470
<i>also known as the Faceless Man,</i>

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:53.770
<i>Takayuki Chiba!</i>

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:01.070
What?

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:06.820
An old man?

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:08.240
Um... hi!

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:12.160
Sir, this isn't the auditorium... what?!

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:25.420
What the hell is that?

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:28.760
An old man suddenly became
a guy with muscles!

00:22:29.130 --> 00:22:30.930
TAKAYUKI CHIBA
YOSHITAKE REAL ESTATE

00:22:31.010 --> 00:22:32.300
Hi! Were you surprised?

00:22:32.720 --> 00:22:34.560
Oh?

00:24:05.980 --> 00:24:06.860
PREVIEW

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:08.730
<i>Doctors need demon's hands</i>
<i>and Buddha's heart.</i>

00:24:08.860 --> 00:24:10.030
<i>It's the heart of medical art.</i>

00:24:10.610 --> 00:24:13.490
<i>However, what if their hands are</i>
<i>possessed by the devil?</i>

00:24:13.820 --> 00:24:15.490
<i>A cruel killer versus the Dissector.</i>

00:24:15.950 --> 00:24:18.120
<i>A sense of morality gets unstable</i>
<i>in madness.</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:20.200
<i>Next episode: "Oddities"</i>

00:24:20.330 --> 00:24:21.740
Subtitle translation by
Hinako Someno
